with open("test.txt", "a") as file1:
    file1.write("\nPain itself is a matter of concern, and the pursuit of it is a chosen path. There is a certain pain, perhaps arising from the varied nature of life, or even from a cat. One might seek a seasoning for life—something potent, yet perhaps also a touch poisonous. There is a ferment, a stirring from the depths. It is not an easy path. One does not simply cast aside the author of one's own circumstances. Time itself unfolds just as it is meant to. Like a vessel, one may hold within oneself the tools—a spade, perhaps—to shape one's own worthiness.\n")